<title>UK: Vickers confirms in talks to sell unit.</title>
<headline>Vickers confirms in talks to sell unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group Vickers Plc on Friday confirmed it was in &quot;promising&quot; talks for the possible sale of its S&amp;W Medico Teknik unit to Sweden's Artema Medical AB.  </p>
<p>Artema announced the talks earlier in Sweden.</p>
<p>&quot;Artema is planning a new share issue in connection with the acquisition of S&amp;W,&quot; Vickers said in its statement.</p>
<p>S&amp;W forms part of Vickers' Medical Division.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
